OL,4,CWork starts to fill high street        
OL,5,C'eyesore' gap                          
OL,6,GWork has started on a long-delayed     
OL,7,Gproject to fill what has previously    
OL,8,Gbeen described as an "eyesore" gap in  
OL,9,Ga town's high street.                  
OL,11,FThe former Barclays Bank in St Ives,   
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, has been shrouded in   
OL,13,Fscaffolding since planning permission  
OL,14,Fwas granted for redevelopment four     
OL,15,Fyears ago.                             
OL,17,FThe St Ives Civic Society had called   
OL,18,Ffor Huntingdonshire District Council   
OL,19,Fto take enforcement action to force    
OL,20,Fthe developer to start work.           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
