OL,4,CPolice appeal for people with          
OL,5,C'unexplained burns'                    
OL,6,GPolice investigating the attempted     
OL,7,Gmurder of an 80-year-old woman are     
OL,8,Gurging people to report anyone seen    
OL,9,Gwith "unexplained or suspicious burns" 
OL,10,Gin the past 10 days.                   
OL,12,FDetectives said Brenda Raymond's       
OL,13,Ffamily "deserve answers" after she was 
OL,14,F"deliberately set on fire" in a        
OL,15,Fcommunal area of a block of flats in   
OL,16,FCaractacus Cottage View, Watford, on 9 
OL,17,FNovember.                              
OL,19,FDet Insp Adam Bridges said it was      
OL,20,Fbelieved the offender was "likely to   
OL,21,Fhave sustained injuries during the     
OL,22,Fattack".                          G2/4 
