OL,4,CAnger as mouldy dumped post is         
OL,5,Cdelivered weeks later                  
OL,6,GRoyal Mail customers have been left    
OL,7,Gfurious after hundreds of letters      
OL,8,Gfailed to arrive in a town - and those 
OL,9,Gthat did were delivered damaged and    
OL,10,Gmouldy weeks later.                    
OL,12,FThe firm has apologised and blamed the 
OL,13,Fincident in Attleborough on post being 
OL,14,Fdumped at Toll's Meadow nature reserve 
OL,15,Fin neighbouring Wymondham, Norfolk.    
OL,16,FThe reserve's warden reported the      
OL,17,Fdiscovery to Royal Mail.               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
