OL,4,CStudents conflicted over plan for MoD  
OL,5,Con campus                              
OL,6,GA student has described potential      
OL,7,Gplans for Ministry of Defence (MoD)    
OL,8,Gpersonnel to share their university    
OL,9,Gcampus as "daunting" while others have 
OL,10,Gwelcomed the idea.                     
OL,12,FThe University of Essex is in          
OL,13,Fdiscussions with the MoD and           
OL,14,FColchester Garrison over the proposal  
OL,15,Fto house 150 personnel on its          
OL,16,FColchester campus.                     
OL,18,FGrace Wren, 21, a speech and language  
OL,19,Ftherapy student, said: "It's kind of   
OL,20,Fdaunting in a way and it's quite scary 
OL,21,Fthat there would be soldiers living    
OL,22,Fnear us."                         G4/4 
